msgctxt "108"
msgid "Please take all complaints directly to the manufacturer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"It's on the second floor of a building near the\r\n"
"Ryudo Family office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Hey, mind if I ask you something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Oh no... Don't tell me you want to return your\r\n"
"Coral Love Necklace, too!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"No, I just wanted to say that it looks like these things\r\n"
"don't really work in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"You'll have to forgive me. It's just that I've been up to my\r\n"
"ears in customers asking for their money back and demanding\r\n"
"I take responsibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"These necklaces have been nothing but trouble since the day\r\n"
"I started carrying them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"If they're so much trouble, then why don't you stop telling\r\n"
"people they'll bring you love and money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "I truly wish I could, but I'm afraid it's not that simple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"These necklaces are the hottest thing going right now. And\r\n"
"since the manufacturer is having such a hard time keeping up\r\n"
"with demand, I can barely even keep them in stock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"After weeks of begging and pleading with them, they finally\r\n"
"let me order another shipment, but only under certain\r\n"
"conditions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Such as?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Well... I'm obligated to tell potential customers these\r\n"
"necklaces will help attract love, luck, and a whole slew of\r\n"
"other random nonsense into their lives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"And if I don't say such things, I've been threatened with\r\n"
"penalty fees and all sorts of other consequences...\r\n"
"I wish they'd just sell out already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Now if you have a complaint to file, would you mind taking\r\n"
"it directly to the manufacturer instead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "And where can I find this manufacturer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"There's a building with a stairwell just south of the\r\n"
"Ryudo Family office. The manufacturer's office is on the\r\n"
"second floor of that building."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Please go there if you're experiencing further issues or are otherwise "
"dissatisfied with your purchase."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Just to make sure, it's the second floor of a building south\r\n"
"of the Ryudo Family office? All right, then."
msgstr ""

